                "title": "Heart Tip Entrance Door Mortise Lockset, Acorn RT6BD / RT6BI",
                "description": "Made out of cast iron, the Heart Tip Entrance Door Mortise Lockset has an old world feel that is only heightened by the rough black finish. This finish mimics the texture of naturally weathered iron so the handleset will be at home in almost any colonial home or historic home restoration project. A mortise lockset, it is for doors 1-3/4 inch to 3 inch thick with a 2-1/2 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. It is available in both single cylinder and dummy cylinder functions.",
